<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34695" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">per-cīdo</span></b> , cīdi,
			cīsum (<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>perf.</i> percecīdi, <i><span class="en">Flor. 4,
				12, 7</span></i>), 3, v. a.
			caedo, <i>to beat</i> or <i>cut to pieces</i>, <i>to smash.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In gen.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">os alicui,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Pers. 2, 4, 12</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id. Cas. 2, 6, 52</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Sen.
				Q. N. 4, 4, 1</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> Esp. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>To cut to pieces</i>, <i>rout
			utterly</i>, <i>destroy</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">exercitum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Flor. 3, 20, 10</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">terga hostium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					4, 12, 7</span></i>
			.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b> In
			mal. part., i. q. paedicare, <i><span class="en">Mart. 4,
				48, 1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">7,
				62, 1 al.</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Sen. Prov. 5, 3</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Mart. 12,
				35, 2</span></i>; cf.: percisus, paedicatus, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεπυγισμένος</span>, Gloss. Philox.; so, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">too, alicui os, i. q. irrumare,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart.
					2, 72, 3</span></i>
			 (al. praecisum).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
